    "md5": "d68bb36c09352ec2376dacdb86f68ef7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1689,
    "chunk_text": "CDB champions women entrepreneurs through CAN Market partnership\n\nCollaboration aims at empowering women entrepreneurs, driving sustainable futures women entrepreneurs supported with financial solutions and community backing\n\nIn a strong move to empower women entrepreneurs reflecting the IWD 2026 theme \u2018Give to Gain\u2019, Citizens Development Business Finance PLC (CDB) reinforced its commitment to empowering women entrepreneurs and sustainable local businesses by partnering with The Creative Isle Ltd. for the International Women\u2019s Day edition of CAN Market. Aligned with the objective of empowering women entrepreneurs within the Wings Ecosystem, this initiative was conducted to provide greater visibility, financial accessibility and digital enablement for women-led businesses. Underlining CDB\u2019s dedication to community-driven initiatives, the MoU signaled a partnership that would further the Market\u2019s eco-conscious lifestyle ethos.\n\nHeld from 6 to 8 March at Arcade Independence Square, Colombo, the Women\u2019s Day edition of CAN Market successfully brought together a vibrant collective of women-led enterprises, creative brands and eco-conscious businesses. The event provided a dynamic platform for local entrepreneurs to showcase their products, connect with conscious consumers and set the stage for future phases of the CAN Market initiative.\n\nVisitors experienced a diverse range of offerings from artisans and women-led businesses, while enjoying the convenience of digital payment solutions. CDB facilitated seamless transactions through QR payments and exclusive benefits for customers using CDB SELF, enhancing both accessibility and overall shopping experience."
