    "chunk_text": "When news  about Sangeetha seeking divorce became public knowledge through the media,Vijay and his top party officials kept mum but Vijay\u2019s supporter minions went to town on social media. Sangeetha was attacked and vilified mercilessly. She was accused of being a DMK stooge and puppet who was making false allegations against the \u201cparagon of Virtue\u201dVijay.It was a DMK hatched plot to spoil Vijay\u2019s electoral prospects, it was alleged.\n\nSubsequently Sangeetha filed an interim petition  before the Chengelpattu court in the first week of March seeking maintenance and residential rights amid their pending divorce case. According to Indian media reports  Sangeetha has requested the court to direct Vijay to pay appropriate maintenance until the divorce case is resolved.In addition to maintenance, Sangeetha has also sought the right to reside in Vijay\u2019s property in Neelankarai, Chennai. She has asked the court to allow her to stay at the house located at Kapaleeswarar Nagar, Neelankarai, through an interim order.\n\nIt is noteworthy that Sangeetha in  the  divorce  petition had referred to her husband\u2019s alleged adulterous relationship with another actress but had pointedly refrained from naming  her or citing her as a third party.  However in a bizarre twist Vijay and the popular Tamil actress Trisha Krishnan travelled together in the same vehicle to attend the wedding of the son of a film producer. Vijay clad in verti and Trisha wearing a saree were dressed in identical colours.\n\nIt appeared that Vijay and Trisha were conveying a message to the world in general  and Sangeetha in particular by this brazen act. The  controversial incident created a furore. For the first time several  persons in the cinema sphere condemned Vijay. While most of  Vijay\u2019s supporters and defenders were struck dumb, a few even criticized him openly. Interestingly the attacks on Sangeetha by Vijay\u2019s supporters lost steam and began drastically declining."
