    "chunk_text": "Trump The Rat When Under Attack Also Hides In Bomb Shelters\n\nOn 14 March 2026, the Federal Communication Commision Chairman Brendan Carr, a Trump-appointed Republican, issued a stern warning to news outlets\u00a0 that if they share \u2018distortions\u2019 about the US war with Iran, they could lose their licences. The administration of President Donald Trump has already warned that news outlets could have their broadcasting licences revoked over critical reporting on the war against Iran, accusing the media of \u201cdistortions\u201d.\n\nBrendan Carr added in a social media post \u00a0on Saturday that broadcasters must \u201coperate in the public interest\u201d, or else lose their licences.\n\nHowever, many commentators have already noted that every press-statement by Trump is a distortion; a lie.\n\nA glaring example is US defence secretary Pete Hegseth\u2019s claim that Iran\u2019s new Supreme Leader Mojtaba Khamenei was \u201cwounded and likely disfigured\u201d and that the country\u2019s leadership was \u201cdesperate and hiding.\u201d\n\n\u201cThey\u2019ve gone underground, cowering. That\u2019s what rats do,\u201d Hegseth said at a Pentagon briefing alongside the chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff.\n\nHegseth also cast doubt on a message attributed to Mojtaba Khamenei that was read on Iranian state television:\n\n\u201cHe put out a statement yesterday, a weak one actually, but there was no voice and there was no video. It was a written statement,\u201d Hegseth said, suggesting he, Khamenei, is dead:\n\n\u201cIran has plenty of cameras and plenty of voice recorders. Why a written statement? I think you know why.\u201d\n\nHe added that the situation inside Iran\u2019s leadership was unclear. \u201cWho\u2019s in charge? Iran may not even know.\u201d\n\nEven as he said this, Trump contradicted Hegseth, in an interview on Fox News Radio that aired on Friday morning claiming \u201cKhamenei is wounded. I think he probably is [alive]. I think he is damaged, but I think he\u2019s probably alive in some form, you know.\u201d"
